  "id": "affective-interaction",
  "term": "affective interaction",
  "definition": "Affective interaction is the emotional side of interaction that helps build a positive relationship base and encourages people’s energy and willingness to engage. It involves creating a warm, low-distance atmosphere, openly expressing feelings such as trust and commitment, and fostering mutual recognition of the relationship and each side’s abilities.",
